ssues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible since at least 4.3.stable\n- Not reproducible until at least 4.2.stable (feature works as expected since its inception in 4.0)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 9 9900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 61.55 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEditorScenePostImportPlugin's callback _get_internal_option_visibility does not work at all.\nThe function is not being called. (print statements don't show up.)\nThe return value is ignored. (properties show up as normal, even when return value is `false`.)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. unzip the mrp\n2. open godot. \n3. create new project in the unzipped folder\n4. (godot 4.3 and later) toggle `create folder` off\n5. confirm the warning to create project in non-empty folder\n6. (open the project)\n7. enable the `importer_test` plugin in project settings\n8. open assets/cube.glb\n9. click the mesh instance or the mesh node\n10. (on versions 4.0 - 4.2) observe that the properties don't show up on the right and that print messages are logged  in the output (expected behavior)\n11. (on versions 4.3 and above) observe that all the properties show up on the right, despite import_plugin.gd implementing _get_internal_option_visibility to return false\n12. (on versions 4.3 and above) also observe that no log message is printed despite _get_internal_option_visibility implementing a print call\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[importer_bug_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26794494/importer_bug_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"ArokhSlade","id":139560570,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFGGeg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139560570?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade","html_url":"https://github.com/ArokhSlade","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118652/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}